OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed cousin while
OL,4,Acamping jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered his cousin while
OL,7,Fthey were camping and lied to emergency
OL,8,Fservices about the circumstances of his
OL,9,Fdeath has been jailed for life.
OL,11,FWayne White attacked Garry Claydon
OL,12,F"with considerable force" while the
OL,13,Fpair were spending the night on
OL,14,Fwasteland in Rotherham in June 2025,
OL,15,FSheffield Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FClaydon, 54, died at the scene, with
OL,18,FWhite calling 999 and claiming his
OL,19,Fcousin had been "beat up" by someone
OL,20,Felse.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
