OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed cousin while
OL,4,Acamping jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite, 54, of Shakespeare Road,
OL,7,FRotherham, did not appear at his
OL,8,Fsentencing as he was "resigned" to a
OL,9,Flife in prison, the hearing was told.
OL,10,FSentenced in his absence, he was given
OL,11,Fa minimum term of 18 years in prison.
